    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the captivating world of &quot;Carpe Dino: Seize the Date,&quot; the dinosaur dating simulator! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, a peaceful Ankylosaurs, lived in your swamps for the last few decades until your routine was roughly interrupted...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A huge Rock now hangs in the sky, and rumors suggest that only a grand journey away from home might save the dinos. However, such a journey cannot be undertaken alone \u2014 you'll have to find a companion for the adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, what exactly awaits you on the twisted roads of ancient Pangea?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 Four Romanceable Characters </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As long as you find dinosaurs romanceable, yes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 Four Non-Romanceable Characters (NPCs = NRCs, hah!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to the insects, plants, and other ancient creatures to learn more about the world around you and guide your way through the burning lands of Pangea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 3+ hours of gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual novel at the core and a topping of several arcade-like mini-games will ensure a rich experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 10 possible endings: Live and Die, Save or Abandon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your way, you will face multiple dangers and inspire your mates to stand against them. Believe little old me, your happily-ever-after won\u2019t come to you easily!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to everyone you can, choose your favorites to accompany you on the run, protect them, and be protected. If you play your cards right, you might even survive the Great Dying :&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though the chances aren't too high.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the captivating world of &quot;Carpe Dino: Seize the Date,&quot; the dinosaur dating simulator! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, a peaceful Ankylosaurs, lived in your swamps for the last few decades until your routine was roughly interrupted...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A huge Rock now hangs in the sky, and rumors suggest that only a grand journey away from home might save the dinos. However, such a journey cannot be undertaken alone \u2014 you'll have to find a companion for the adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, what exactly awaits you on the twisted roads of ancient Pangea?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 Four Romanceable Characters </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As long as you find dinosaurs romanceable, yes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 Four Non-Romanceable Characters (NPCs = NRCs, hah!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to the insects, plants, and other ancient creatures to learn more about the world around you and guide your way through the burning lands of Pangea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 3+ hours of gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual novel at the core and a topping of several arcade-like mini-games will ensure a rich experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 10 possible endings: Live and Die, Save or Abandon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your way, you will face multiple dangers and inspire your mates to stand against them. Believe little old me, your happily-ever-after won\u2019t come to you easily!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to everyone you can, choose your favorites to accompany you on the run, protect them, and be protected. If you play your cards right, you might even survive the Great Dying :&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though the chances aren't too high.</p>",
